|---|---|
| `fn` succeeds on first try | Returns result immediately |
| `fn` fails but succeeds within retries | Returns result after successful attempt |
| `fn` fails all attempts | Throws error with attempt count |
| `delay` is set | Waits between each retry |
| `onRetry` is set | Called before each retry with the error and attempt number |

