### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `async/await` | Works seamlessly with both sync and async callbacks |
| `attempt` passed to `fn` | Allows the callback to adapt its behavior per attempt |
| `cause` on thrown error | Preserves the original error for debugging |
| `onRetry` hook | Enables logging/monitoring without coupling it to the core logic |
| Separate backoff variant | Keeps the base function simple while offering a common pattern |

